  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Programme - Building resilient systems for integrated water resource management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will&#xA0;introduce integrated water resource management (IWRM) approaches into&#xA0;local, national and regional systems to improve water security.
Its goal is to increase resilience to climate change&#xA0;by supporting Pacific Island Countries to effectively manage water resources through:&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Pacific Island countries are implementing more integrated approaches to water resource management; and&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Effective national and regional coordination enhances investment in the water sector.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
